================================================================================
SIS (Secure Init System)
Unified Specification + Policy Language (SIS-Policy)
Version: 0.2 Concept Draft
================================================================================

CORE DESIGN PHILOSOPHY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

• Minimal trusted core (PID 1 only essentials)
• Everything else is modular and optional
• Security is enforced through a unified policy language
• No hidden behavior
• Deterministic boot
• Fully auditable system state
• Capability-based service control
• Event-driven architecture
• Policy-first security model

================================================================================
CORE PID 1 RESPONSIBILITIES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

SIS Core Only:

• Process 1 (PID 1)
• Boot orchestration
• Dependency resolution engine
• Service supervision
• Module loader
• Event dispatcher
• Policy enforcement engine (SIS-Policy runtime)
• Secure shutdown / reboot / recovery

Nothing else is required in core.

