TOR MODULE INTEGRATION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

• Optional module
• Policy-controlled activation
• Can be required per-service
• Supports onion-only mode
• Supports transparent proxy mode
• Must satisfy:

    require network if service.requires_tor == true

