================================================================================
SECURITY PROFILES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Minimal:
• Core only
• No enforcement modules except critical

Desktop:
• Standard services
• Moderate sandboxing

Server:
• Signed services required
• Logging enabled
• Firewall enforced

Anonymous:
• Tor required
• DNS leak protection
• No clearnet allowed

High Security:
• TPM attestation required
• All modules signed
• Strict policy enforcement
• Immutable configuration

Air Gap:
• Network disabled
• USB strictly controlled
• Offline-only operations

================================================================================
AUDIT SYSTEM
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

• Immutable logs
• Policy decision logging
• Event chain verification
• Signed audit records
• Remote audit replication (optional)

Logs include:

• allow/deny decisions
• service start/stop events
• device attach/detach events
• policy violations
• module loading/unloading

================================================================================
ANTI-FINGERPRINTING (OPTIONAL MODULE)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

• Randomized service timing (policy-controlled)
• Identifier normalization
• Network fingerprint reduction
• Optional entropy of system timing (bounded)

